                                "sense_id": "54d98b17-ddf8-3769-8131-7e03752a7b5d",
                                "text": "“One thing at least is certain,” remarked King Helmas, frowning uglily, “and it is that among the Peohtes all persons who dispute our prophecies are burned at the stake.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e045497-2159-46ef-ac11-b7b4b2843a14",
                                "sense_id": "54d98b17-ddf8-3769-8131-7e03752a7b5d",
                                "text": "Food was pleasant; the sun hot; and this killing oneself, how does one set about it, with a table knife, uglily, with floods of blood,—by sucking a gaspipe?"
                            }
